  id: Scene12_FAQ_3
  speaker: WATTSON
  text: 'Careful, detective: it is the other way round. A thicker wire gives the
    charges more room to flow, so it has less resistance. The comparison kept the
    length and thickness the same on purpose, so only the material differed.'
